<title>SWITZERLAND: UBS keeps 1996 dividend steady.</title>
<headline>UBS keeps 1996 dividend steady.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland said it would keep the dividend on 1996 results unchanged at 32 Swiss francs per bearer share and 6.40 francs per registered share.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
